      "parameters": {
        "width": 1100,
        "height": 260,
        "content": "## ECC lead finder — DRAFTS ONLY, sends nothing\nSearches Apollo (free) for 4 segments x 5 people, skips anyone already in **ECC Outreach**, spends Apollo credits only on new people (max 20/day), keeps verified work emails, AI writes a personal email, saves it as `pending_approval`.\nReview drafts in Data tables → ECC Outreach: edit subject/body freely, set status to `rejected` for any you don't want.\nThen run **ECC - Send approved outreach**.\nCredentials: Header Auth `Apollo API` (name `x-api-key`, master API key) on both Apollo nodes; OpenAI (FreeLLMAPI) on the AI model."
      }
    }
